coverage
# throwaway Playwright probes, kept out of `git add -A`
probe-*.mjs
# the baked word audio. ~900 clips, ~9MB, and `scripts/make-audio.mjs` makes
# them again from a key in about two minutes — a build artefact with a long
# name, not source. Keeping them out means the repo stays a text repo, a voice
# change is not a 9MB diff, and nobody has to review a binary. The cost is that
# a fresh clone has no audio until the bake is run; the app is built to fall
# back to the device voice in exactly that case, which is also how it ships
# today. The iOS build gets them from `dist/` via `npx cap sync`, so the bake
# has to happen before the build that feeds a TestFlight upload.
public/audio/

# build info + screenshots the e2e drives write when SHOT_DIR is unset
*.tsbuildinfo
/*.png
# where `npm run drives` puts them instead
e2e-shots/
